### Identity Provider B — Verify (synchronous) - example
POST https://api.identity-provider-b.example/v1/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "subject": {
    "firstName": "Alice",
    "lastName": "Example",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "phone": "+391234567890",
    "document": {
      "type": "id_card",
      "number": "AB1234567",
      "country": "IT"
    }
  }
}

### Identity Provider B — Verify (async) - example (returns 202)
POST https://api.identity-provider-b.example/v1/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "subject": {
    "firstName": "Bob",
    "lastName": "Example",
    "email": "bob@example.com",
    "phone": "+391234567891",
    "document": {
      "type": "passport",
      "number": "P12345678",
      "country": "IT"
    }
  },
  "callbackUrl": "https://onboarding.example.com/webhooks/verification"
}

### Identity Provider B — Webhook example (server -> onboarding)
POST https://onboarding.example.com/webhooks/verification
X-Idp-Signature: sha256=abcdef1234567890
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verificationId": "verif-2222",
  "requestId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "status": "verified",
  "score": 0.98,
  "issuedAt": "2026-06-09T12:00:00Z",
  "metadata": {}
}
